# =============================================================
# What IS committed:
#   code/          — all scripts (01_intake.py through run_all.py)
#   docs/          — CLAUDE.md, variables.json, novelty_assessment.md, pre_analysis_plan.md
#   CLAUDE.md      — project constitution
#   meta.md        — living decisions log
#   README.md      — project overview
#   .gitignore     — this file
#   Theory/        — source working paper PDF
#   tests/         — verification scripts
#
# What is NOT committed:
#   data/raw/      — raw calibration data (document provenance in README instead)
#   data/processed/— regenerable from pipeline
#   output/        — regenerable from pipeline (commit milestone snapshots manually)
# =============================================================

